#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Ebe Nchekwa Nzere Nzuzo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Faịlụ Igodo Ebe Nchekwa Nzuzo"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored BMC passwords. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write; the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored passwords must be entered again."
msgstr "Ụzọ zuru oke gaa na igodo 32-byte nke na-ezochi okwuntụghe BMC echekwara. Mepụta ya n'onwe gị, n'èzí mgbọrọgwụ weebụ, nke naanị sava weebụ na onye ọrụ poller nwere ike ịgụ, n'ime ndekọ nke naanị root na onye ọrụ ahụ nwere ike ide ihe na ya; plugin ahụ anaghị emepụta ma ọ bụ dee ya. Kwado ya na nchekwa data: na-enweghị ya, a ga-etinyerịrị okwuntụghe echekwara ọzọ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Onye Nchịkọta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Interval"
msgstr "Oge Etiti Nchịkọta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between reads of each BMC."
msgstr "Sekọnd dị n'etiti ọgụgụ nke BMC ọ bụla."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Rediscovery Interval"
msgstr "Etiti Oge Nchọpụta Ọzọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds between full resource discoveries of each BMC. A BMC is also rediscovered at once when a known resource disappears or changes type."
msgstr "Sekọnd dị n'etiti nchọpụta akụrụngwa zuru oke nke BMC ọ bụla. A na-achọpụtakwa BMC ozugbo mgbe akụrụngwa a maara furu efu ma ọ bụ gbanwee ụdị."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Oke Oge Onye Nchịkọta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new BMCs. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished BMCs resume on the next run."
msgstr "Sekọnd otu ọsọ onye nchịkọta nwere ike iji tupu ọ kwụsị ịmalite BMC ọhụrụ. Debe ya n'okpuru etiti oge poller; BMC ndị a na-emeghịcha ga-amaliteghachi na ọsọ na-esote."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "BMCs read in parallel. Each BMC is read by one worker at a time."
msgstr "BMC ndị a na-agụ n'otu oge. Otu onye ọrụ na-agụ BMC ọ bụla n'otu oge."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Workers"
msgstr "Ndị Ọrụ Nchịkọta"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Connect Timeout"
msgstr "Oke Oge Njikọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for the TCP connection and TLS handshake to a BMC."
msgstr "Sekọnd e nyere maka njikọ TCP na nkwenye aka TLS na BMC."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Request Timeout"
msgstr "Oge Njedebe Arịrịọ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds allowed for one whole request to a BMC, including the connection."
msgstr "Sekọnd e nyere maka otu arịrịọ zuru oke na BMC, gụnyere njikọ ahụ."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "KiB accepted in one BMC response body; a larger response is refused."
msgstr "KiB a nabatara n'otu ahụ nzaghachi BMC; a na-ajụ nzaghachi buru ibu karịa."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Response Size"
msgstr "Oke Nha Nzaghachi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Freshness"
msgstr "Ịdị Ọhụrụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is shown as delayed."
msgstr "Etiti oge nchịkọta nke mgbe ọ gasịrị a na-egosi ọgụgụ dị ka nke e gbuoro oge."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Delayed After"
msgstr "E Gbuoro Oge Mgbe"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection intervals after which a reading is stale and reads as unknown. Always at least one more than Delayed After."
msgstr "Etiti oge nchịkọta nke mgbe ọ gasịrị ọgụgụ bụ ochie ma gụọ dị ka amaghị. Na-abụ mgbe niile opekata mpe otu karịa E Gbuoro Oge Mgbe."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Stale After"
msgstr "Bụrụ Ochie Mgbe"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Wepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Debe Tebụl Mgbakwunye Mgbe A Na-ewepụ"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its BMC registry, encrypted passwords, and reading cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Uninstall never touches Cacti devices, graphs, or BMCs, including devices the plugin created."
msgstr "Mgbe a tụrụ ya akara, iwepụ plugin ahụ na-edebe ndekọ BMC ya, okwuntụghe ezoro ezo, na cache ọgụgụ. Hichapụ akara ya ka iwepụ wepụ ha. Iwepụ anaghị emetụ ngwaọrụ Cacti, eserese, ma ọ bụ BMC aka, gụnyere ngwaọrụ plugin ahụ mepụtara."

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against the system CA store"
msgstr "Kwenye megide ụlọ nchekwa CA nke sistemụ"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Verify against a CA bundle file"
msgstr "Kwenye megide faịlụ ngwugwu CA"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Pinned public key (SHA-256)"
msgstr "Igodo ọha e nyere pin (SHA-256)"

#: lib/TlsMode.php
msgid "Do not verify (unsafe)"
msgstr "Ekwenyela (adịghị nchebe)"

